    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the wing anti-ice shut-off valve solenoid and position sensing installation, with the pre and post high force solenoid standards shown as alternates at the same item numbers.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "Illustrated parts breakdown of the solenoid and position sensing installation on a wing anti-ice shut-off valve, covering both solenoid standards and the associated sealing hardware.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn looking outboard at the left hand inboard valve; the right hand installation is the mirror image and uses the same part numbers. The alternates at item 10 are the two solenoid standards and they are not interchangeable, because the armature length sets the closed position of the butterfly. The sealing washers at item 40 are single use and are supplied in the quantity for one valve. The harness support clamp position differs between the two standards and is shown on sheet 2."
    },
